rge financial advantage, having raised roughly five times as much as Democrat Justin Early. Every major expert rating, from Cook to Sabato to Inside Elections, places the seat in the Safe or Solid Republican column.\n\nEarly, a first-time candidate, has run an active local campaign but lacks the money and profile to alter the district's fundamentals, and a Green Party contender also appears on the ballot. No public general-election polling exists, so the outlook rests on district lean, ratings, and market pricing, all of which point firmly to Carter. The main uncertainty is the size of any national Democratic tide, which would need to be unusually large to matter here.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0328, "margin": -14.67}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0442, "margin": -15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0454, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.036, "margin": -15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.0275, "margin": -15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0304, "margin": -15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0331, "margin": -15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.0323, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0129, "margin": -15.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.0246, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.0251, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.0249, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.0403, "margin": -12.6}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.0208, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.0404, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.0259, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.0438, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.018, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.0319, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.0226, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.0328, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.0268, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0